WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:06.096
IN is a membership operator The inner query should
return a one-column

00:00:06.122 --> 00:00:13.356
set The outer value is compared with the values in
that set If

00:00:13.370 --> 00:00:18.987
it matches one of them the membership test succeeds
Think of IN as

00:00:19.013 --> 00:00:21.566
asking is this value in that returned list
